# AI project rules

Read root `AGENTS.md` before modifying agent code.

## CrewAI

- Use `crewai.LLM` with LiteLLM model strings from `config/ai/models.json`
- YAML config: `apps/agent/src/project_agent/config/agents.yaml` and `tasks.yaml`
- Package manager: `uv` (run commands from `apps/agent/`)

## Prompts & routing

- System prompts in `prompts/system/` — not hardcoded in Python for production paths
- Model routing in `config/ai/routing.json` — update evals when changed

## Secrets

- Never commit API keys or GCP service account files
- Use `.env` (see `.env.example`)

## Providers in use

OpenAI (GPT), Anthropic (Claude), Google Gemini, Vertex AI (GCP), Grok (xAI), Manus IM (external channel)